  "design": {
    "idea": "Z-zigzag turning hedge maze: record an Echo shooting the local room sundial after a 2.5s delay, slip through Hour-1 Clock Gate 1, and let your past self flip the room to Hour 2 to swing Gate 2 open ahead.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Alternating clock_gate hedges rotate on hg_room_hour; Echoes can turn the room clock after you cross the first gate.",
    "decisions": 9,
    "expert_s": 50,
    "reward": "hg_r4_open+35_shards",
    "why": "Marries the Hourglass Maze's turning hedges with delayed Echo Rose causal timing and a mid-hedge Topiary Knight encounter.",
